WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.360
<v S5>Roger, Roger.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.380
<v S1>We have main engine start.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.620
<v S1><c.number>Four,</c> <c.number>three,</c>
<c.number>two,</c> <c.number>one.</c>

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.600
<v S5>Now.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.417
<v Celia>You're a jerk, Thom!

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.109
<v Thom>Look, Celia,
we have to follow <c.key>our</c> <c.key>passions.</c>

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:30.700
<v Thom>You have your robotics
and I just want to be <c.key>awesome</c> <c.key>in</c> <c.key>space.</c>

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.583
<v Celia>Why don’t you just admit that you’re
freaked out by my <c.key>robot</c> <c.key>hand?</c>

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.330
<v Thom>I’m not freaked out by it.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:40.200
<v Thom>It’s… All right, fine.
I’m freaked out. I’m having nightmares

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.900
<v Thom>that I’m being chased by these
giant <c.key>robotic</c> <c.key>claws</c> <c.key>of</c> <c.key>death.</c>

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.060
<v Celia>Oh, <c.emphasis>whatever,</c> Thom!
We’re done.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:53.680
<v S4>Robot’s memory synced
and locked.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.400
<v S5>This is pretty freaky.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.408
<v Barley>Shouldn’t you be down there?

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.518
<v S5>I heard you guys talking last night.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.148
<v S5>It’s not my fault, you know.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:14.852
<v S5>Are you ready? Of course you’re ready,
you’re a <c.key>rock</c> <c.key>star.</c>

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.691
<v S5>How’s it looking, Barley?

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.842
<v Barley>We should have about <c.number>ten</c> <c.number>minutes.</c>

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:23.056
<v S5>Well, that’s perfect.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.680
<v Barley>We’re on one.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.560
<v S7>All systems go.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.680
<v Barley>Yeah, you, go! Go!

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.220
<v Barley><c.emphasis>Move</c> your asses.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:34.180
<v Barley>Go, go, go!
I love it!

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.640
<v S5>Come on!
Go!

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:45.980
<v S5>That’s nice.
Nothing to worry about, Thom.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:51.760
<v S5>Thom,

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.300
<v S5>there she is.
Now, you love her.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:58.678
<v S5>She’s your passion.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:02.080
<v S5>Be <c.key>tender</c> to her.
Be honest.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:04.740
<v S5>Be tender.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.920
<v S5>Remind her
what love is.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:54.430
<v S5>And…

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:55.430
<v S4>action!

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.448
<v S4><c.key>Memory</c> <c.key>override</c> in progress.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:00.520
<v S5>You’re a jerk, Thom.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.200
<v S4><c.soft>Oh,</c> <c.soft>sorry.</c>

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:04.800
<v Thom>Sorry.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.200
<v Thom>Sorry.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.040
<v Thom>Look, Celia,

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.244
<v Thom>we have to follow our passions.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.755
<v Thom>You have your robotics

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.720
<v Thom>and…
I just want to be awesome in space.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.179
<v Barley>Okay, they're coming.
<c.number>Two</c> <c.number>minutes</c> left. <c.number>Two</c> <c.number>minutes.</c>

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:43.999
<v S5>Speed it up, Thom!

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.040
<v Celia><c.emphasis>Vivacissimo!</c>

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:50.943
<v Celia>Why don’t you just admit
that you’re freaked out by my robot hand?

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.820
<v Thom>Listen, Celia,
I was young

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.217
<v Thom>and a dick,
but that's no reason to <c.key>destroy</c> <c.key>the</c> <c.key>world.</c>

00:06:05.088 --> 00:06:06.265
<v S8>Why does he do this?

00:06:07.148 --> 00:06:08.678
<v S5>We already tried that one!

00:06:11.988 --> 00:06:13.888
<v S5><c.emphasis>Abort!</c>
Cut!

00:06:14.208 --> 00:06:15.208
<v Thom>Whoa!

00:06:20.848 --> 00:06:21.848
<v Thom>No! No!

00:06:23.628 --> 00:06:24.948
<v S5>You <c.key>broke</c> <c.key>my</c> <c.key>heart.</c>

00:06:26.148 --> 00:06:27.148
<v Thom>I know.

00:06:27.228 --> 00:06:28.648
<v Celia>You forgot me on Earth.

00:06:29.508 --> 00:06:32.128
<v Celia>I know.
I should just <c.emphasis>crush</c> you!

00:06:47.468 --> 00:06:48.468
<v Thom>I’m… I’m sorry.

00:06:50.388 --> 00:06:51.388
<v S5>Good ad lib.

00:06:59.388 --> 00:07:00.388
<v S4>Not my fault.

00:07:02.368 --> 00:07:03.368
<v S4><c.soft>This</c> <c.soft>time.</c>

00:07:08.608 --> 00:07:10.848
<v Barley>Quiet on set.
We're out of time.

00:07:10.848 --> 00:07:11.907
<v Barley>We're out of time!

00:08:24.068 --> 00:08:25.688
<v S4>Memory override at <c.number>90%.</c>

00:08:26.528 --> 00:08:28.368
<v S9>Captain,
we have to <c.emphasis>abort!</c>

00:08:39.228 --> 00:08:40.817
<v Thom>The <c.key>world’s</c> <c.key>changed,</c> Celia.

00:08:55.148 --> 00:08:56.148
<v S10>Maybe we can too.

00:08:58.268 --> 00:08:59.739
<v S4><c.key>Memory</c> <c.key>override</c> <c.key>complete.</c>

00:09:19.208 --> 00:09:20.208
<v S5>You know,

00:09:21.988 --> 00:09:24.400
<v S5>there’s a lesson to be learned from this.

00:09:25.988 --> 00:09:27.165
<v S8>Could've gone worse.
